Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_Legendary_InfernalResistance</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_Legendary_InfernalResistance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_Legendary_InfernalResistance\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Evasion\" title=\"Infernal Evasion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Evasion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Evasion\" title=\"Infernal Evasion\">Infernal Evasion</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Boots\" title=\"Helldusk Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Helldusk_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Boots\" title=\"Helldusk Boots\">Helldusk Boots</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction works internally by adjusting the roll to add +99 to the result.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On spells that have both an attack roll and a saving throw roll, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnaring Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike\">Ensnaring Strike</a>, the +99 will be added to the attacker's attack roll instead of the defender's saving throw roll.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200933\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2541/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26941/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9467/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1438763/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   58.023      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   58.023      1 -total\n 84.78%   49.190     32 Template:Trim\n 19.52%   11.325      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.64%    7.917      1 Template:Resource\n 11.73%    6.804      4 Template:Icon_text\n 10.45%    6.064      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n  9.77%    5.669      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.95%    5.195      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.15%    4.729      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:53120-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200933 